# ---------- Controls menu: choose each player's input device ($05c2a-$0664c) ----------
F_05c2a ControlsMenu_Init
@ControlsMenu_Init ControlsMenu_Init() : builds the 4 pages of the controller menu (one per game
@ControlsMenu_Init mode). Page record (12 bytes, gControlsPages[4]): +$00.l item count,
@ControlsMenu_Init +$04.l cursor, +$08.l -> items. Item record (20 bytes): +$00.l value (device),
@ControlsMenu_Init +$04.l value count, +$08.l player 0-3 (4 = START GAME), +$0c label, +$10 -> ControllerNames.
F_05e1c ControlsMenu_Run
@ControlsMenu_Run ControlsMenu_Run() : d0.w = 1 START GAME chosen, 0 cancelled. Shows the page for
@ControlsMenu_Run the current game mode (PLAYER 1-4 / START GAME), up/down move, left/right/fire
@ControlsMenu_Run change the device, resolves conflicts, writes the choices to gOptions and
@ControlsMenu_Run switches the IKBD to mouse or joystick mode (Controls_ApplyIkbdMode).
F_06058 ControlsMenu_SaveToOptions
@ControlsMenu_SaveToOptions ControlsMenu_SaveToOptions(a0 = page) : copies each PLAYER item's device into
@ControlsMenu_SaveToOptions gOptions (+$08/+$0e/+$14/+$1a = controller of players 1-4); wraps bad values to 0.
F_0611e ControlsMenu_LoadFromOptions
@ControlsMenu_LoadFromOptions ControlsMenu_LoadFromOptions(a0 = page) : fills each PLAYER item's value
@ControlsMenu_LoadFromOptions from the player controllers stored in gOptions.
F_061c6 ControlsMenu_GetCursor
@ControlsMenu_GetCursor ControlsMenu_GetCursor() : d0.w = cursor (selected item) of the current page.
F_061d2 ControlsMenu_SetCursor
@ControlsMenu_SetCursor ControlsMenu_SetCursor(d0.w = item) : sets the cursor of the current page.
F_061e2 ControlsMenu_GetItem
@ControlsMenu_GetItem ControlsMenu_GetItem(d0.w = index) : a0 = item record of the current page.
F_061fc ControlsMenu_GetItemCount
@ControlsMenu_GetItemCount ControlsMenu_GetItemCount() : d0.w = number of items on the current page.
F_06208 ControlsMenu_FixConflicts
@ControlsMenu_FixConflicts ControlsMenu_FixConflicts() : after the selected player changed device,
@ControlsMenu_FixConflicts every other human player using the same device (or a clashing one: keyboard,
@ControlsMenu_FixConflicts mouse vs joystick 0, team-tap pads) is moved to the first free device.
@ControlsMenu_FixConflicts Device 14 (CPU) never clashes.
F_06622 Controls_IsTeamTap0
@Controls_IsTeamTap0 Controls_IsTeamTap0(d0.l = device) : d0.b = 1 if device 6-9 (TEAM TAP 0 pad A-D).
F_06638 Controls_IsTeamTap1
@Controls_IsTeamTap1 Controls_IsTeamTap1(d0.l = device) : d0.b = 1 if device 10-13 (TEAM TAP 1 pad A-D).
B_2338c gControlsPages
@gControlsPages gControlsPages[4] (12 bytes each) : controller menu pages, see ControlsMenu_Init.
B_233bc gControlsPage
@gControlsPage gControlsPage.l : pointer to the page in use (= gControlsPages[game mode]).
B_233c0 gControlsItems
@gControlsItems gControlsItems : item records (20 bytes) of controller menu pages 0 and 1.
D_19bf4 ControllerNames
@ControllerNames ControllerNames[15] : device names: 0 KEYBOARD, 1 MOUSE, 2-3 JOYSTICK 0/1,
@ControllerNames 4-5 JAGUAR PAD A/B, 6-9 TEAM TAP 0 PAD A-D, 10-13 TEAM TAP 1 PAD A-D, 14 CPU.

